# (0.23) The shell: print (each file a job "/PRN:Shell"; a missing file; no argument) and
# run of a BASIC listing ("Run in Atari": classic_mount kind 4, emu816's log); the card gets
# tests/mk23.py's additions (a clock: the jobs' names have running times)
500 {esc}
+1500 print README.TXT nosuch.txt LONG.TXT\n
+3000 print\n
+1500 ls /Printouts\n
+2000 run HELLO.LST\n
+3000 {F12}
+1500 run nosuch.bas\n
+2000 run README.TXT\n
